# The Neutrinos: "Alliance - Whenever another creature you control enters, The Neutrinos get +1/+0 until end of turn. Whenever The Neutrinos attack, exile up to one target creature you own,
# then return it to the battlefield under your control tapped and attacking." On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with The Neutrinos alone and exiles Memnite, which was summoning sick at home: it comes
# back tapped and attacking (CR 508.4) and, entering, gives The Neutrinos +1/+0. Bot1 may not choose Bot2's Ornithopter ("you own"). The Neutrinos deal 3 flying and Memnite 1: Bot2 on 16.

